---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Editorial, technology, and science disclaimer for Micro Signal Cosmos. Important limitations regarding published articles and guides."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#0B0F19] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/20 bg-sky-400/5 px-4 py-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#00D2FF]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-sky-300 uppercase">
            Editorial Notice
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Publication <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Disclaimer</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
          Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Last Revised: November 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Article -->
      <article class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#151C2E] p-8 sm:p-12 text-sm leading-8 text-slate-300 space-y-8">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. General Educational Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            The content published on <strong class="text-white">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong>—including analytical articles, news commentaries, scientific summaries, artificial intelligence guides, and digital tutorials—is provided solely for general educational, exploratory, and informational purposes. It is crafted to stimulate curiosity and deepen conceptual understanding.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. No Professional Advice</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Nothing published on Micro Signal Cosmos constitutes professional, engineering, medical, legal, cybersecurity, financial, or investment advice:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-400">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Technical Implementations:</strong> When attempting coding tutorials, hardware configurations, or software installations, you should always test in isolated sandbox environments and back up your data. We are not responsible for software incompatibilities or data issues occurring on your machines.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Financial & Technology Markets:</strong> Any discussion of market trends, semiconductor industries, artificial intelligence companies, or digital assets is editorial commentary, not financial or investment advice.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Fast-Moving Scientific & Technological Fields</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Science and technology evolve at extraordinary speed. Research findings, software frameworks, algorithms, and technical documentation change continuously. While our editorial staff strives to verify facts at the date of publication, articles may naturally become superseded by newer discoveries, software version releases, or academic consensus over time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. External References & Third-Party Products</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Our articles frequently reference third-party tools, open-source repositories, academic research papers, scientific institutions, and external websites. These references are provided solely for reader context and scholarly citation. Micro Signal Cosmos does not endorse, control, or assume responsibility for the accuracy or practices of external platforms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Fair Use & Trademarks</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            All brand names, product titles, registered trademarks, service marks, and company names mentioned throughout Micro Signal Cosmos remain the exclusive intellectual property of their respective owners. Their mention in our articles is solely for identification, descriptive reporting, critique, and commentary under fair use standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. Corrections Policy & Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            We are dedicated to accuracy. If you notice a factual error, broken link, or misleading explanation, please contact our editorial desk so we can review and update the content:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0B0F19] p-5 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-1">
            <p><strong class="text-white">Publication:</strong> Micro Signal Cosmos (Independent Digital Publication)</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Editorial Corrections:</strong> corrections@microsignalcosmos.com</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">General Inquiries:</strong> contact@microsignalcosmos.com</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Reader Communications:</strong> Available through our official <a href="/contact/" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">Contact Desk</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

